": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [1258.91259765625, 841.5177001953125], "pos": [-913.8671264648438, 955.9701538085938], "id": 185, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [384], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["### 中文翻译\n无论参考图原本的背景是白色、户外还是其他场景，将全部背景替换为实色纯白无缝幕布，绝对平面白色，无阴影、无渐变色、无噪点，剔除所有多余物体。\n\n生成一张非对称双分区布局的单张图像：\n‑左侧区域（约占总宽度三分之一）：取景范围为头部至腰部。人物正对镜头，双眼直视镜头，双肩平行于画面平面；面部完全对称，头部不转动、不倾斜。姿态自然，完整呈现人物神态、发型以及上衣细节。\n\n‑右侧区域（约占总宽度三分之二）：同一人物的正交全身正、侧、背三视图，严格统一人体比例与垂直对齐基准：\n  •正视图：从头到脚的完整全身照，人物正对镜头，站姿松弛自然。\n  •侧视图：标准90°纯侧面全身照，姿态自然。\n  •后视图：全身背面视角，展示后脑勺、躯干、腿部，画面高度、脚部基准线和另外两个视图完全一致。\n\n左右分区由一条0.1像素白线隔开；右侧三张全身视图之间额外添加两条0.1像素细白色竖线。所有0.1像素白色分割线条笔直、间距均等，版式简约规整。\n\n整张画面统一使用专业影棚布光：柔和定向主光、自然的阴影层次、真实明暗对比。左侧胸像肖像：保证眼部细节清晰，保留原生皮肤纹理，精准还原面料质感，严禁过度磨皮修饰。右侧三视图光影逻辑保持统一，布料垂坠效果写实，四肢比例符合人体结构，轮廓光影过渡自然。所有视图均保留原生发丝纹理。\n\n严格复刻参考图中人物的五官、面部比例、发型、身形、服饰以及全部造型。所有分区均使用实色纯白背景。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "Text白色背景提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [408.3856506347656, 672.5322265625], "pos": [-1732.11279296875, 218.9276123046875], "id": 186, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [337], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["7a0b5a434bc9bbc225d4e9139b13f4be8f59266f8a1b27bf64dababa25dab870.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [405.79095458984375, 689.5795288085938], "pos": [-2169.16064453125, 207.30392456054688], "id": 160, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.50", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["Replace the original background of the reference image (white‑toned, outdoor or other environments) entirely with a premium two‑panel studio‑portrait layout on a textured solid‑gray seamless backdrop. The gray backdrop features soft gradient transitions and subtle film grain, maintaining uniformity across all areas with no extraneous environmental elements.\n\nProduce a single‑frame image with an asymmetrical two‑section layout:\n‑Left panel (approximately one‑third of the total width): A bust‑shot close‑up framed from head down to the waist. The subject faces the camera head‑on and stares straight into the lens, with shoulders parallel to the image plane. The face is perfectly symmetrical without any head rotation or tilt. A natural posture is kept to fully display facial expression, hairstyle and top‑wear details.\n‑Right panel (approximately two‑thirds of the total width): Orthographic full‑‑body front, profile and rear views of the identical character under strictly consistent scale and vertical baseline:\n  •Front view: A full‑length head‑to‑toe shot facing the camera in a relaxed natural standing posture\n  •Profile view: A strict 90‑degree pure‑side full‑body shot with a natural stance\n  •Rear view: A full‑body back‑angle shot showing the back of the head, torso and legs, matching the exact frame height and foot baseline of the other two views\n\nSeparate the left‑right panels with one thin transparent vertical divider. Add another two thin transparent vertical dividers between the three full‑body shots on the right. All transparent dividing lines are straight and evenly spaced for a minimalist, tidy layout.\n\nImplement unified professional studio lighting for the whole frame: soft directional key light, natural shadow depth and authentic light‑dark contrast. For the left‑side bust portrait: retain crisp eye details, original skin texture and accurate fabric rendering; excessive skin‑smoothing or airbrushing is forbidden. The three full‑body views on the right follow identical lighting logic with lifelike fabric draping, anatomically‑correct limb proportions and natural contour‑light falloff. Original hair texture is preserved in every perspective.\n\nThe subject’s facial features, facial proportions, hairstyle, physique, outfit and overall styling must strictly duplicate the reference image. The same textured gray studio backdrop is applied to all panels.\n\nText, watermarks, logos, subtitles, UI elements, borders, panel labels (A/B/C/1/2/3), angle notations, dimension lines and any other redundant elements are prohibited."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "灰色背景提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [408.3856506347656, 672.5322265625], "pos": [-2727.93896484375, 204.24749755859375], "id": 197, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R